 7.3 Error codes
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

The two chats can encounter these errors:

ERROR #1    Can't open transamiga.library

The  program  could  not  locate  transamiga.library.  Please  check if the
library is still in LIBS:.

ERROR #2    Can't find TransAmiga line XX

The  specified TransAmiga line is currently not active or can't be accessed
right now.

ERROR #3    Error while reading config file

The config file was not found. Check option -c for the correct path.

ERROR #4    Error while reading tempfile

The  temporary  file that is generated while execution could not be read or
opened.  This can happen if the system memory runs low or something deleted
the file while the chat is running.

ERROR #5    Can't open picture

The  ANSI picture specified specified in the script was not found. Check if
the path is correct.

ERROR #6    Can't open yell script

The yell script was not found. Check if the path is correct.

ERROR #7    Syntax Error in Yellfile Line X

An error in line X in the yellprg was found. Please check the syntax in this
line.

